                    "persona": "Black Elvis"
                },
                {
                    "n": "9",
                    "text": "Target my focus on, internal thinkin by myself",
                    "rhyme": "Elf",
                    "persona": "Black Elvis"
                },
                {
                    "n": "10",
                    "text": "You catch the treatments hiatus like jam on the shelf",
