                    "persona": "Black Elvis"
                },
                {
                    "n": "12",
                    "text": "I tape up boxes callin Mayflower, every hour",
                    "rhyme": "uR",
                    "persona": "Black Elvis"
                },
                {
                    "n": "13",
                    "text": "You scratch your brain out, askin neighbors what, now you wonder",
